flowchart TB
    accTitle: A delegated issue becomes a verified pull request
    accDescr: Paws authorizes and assigns work at a specific commit. The agent can ask questions in Linear and repair a candidate after verification. An accepted candidate proceeds through publication and merge guards, with the outcome sent back to Linear.
    I[Delegate an issue in Linear]
    X[Check identity, repository access and dependencies]
    W[Assign signed command, generation, lease and grant]
    R[Prepare repository bundle at assigned base SHA]
    A[Run agent through ACP]
    Q{Human decision required?}
    L[Ask and answer in Linear]
    C[Return exact candidate SHA and evidence]
    V{Closeout accepts candidate?}
    F[Repair candidate using findings]
    P[Publish exact candidate and open pull request]
    M[Apply merge guards and serial merge]
    U[Report outcome and unblock dependencies in Linear]
    I --> X --> W --> R --> A --> Q
    Q -->|yes| L --> A
    Q -->|no| C --> V
    V -->|repair| F --> A
    V -->|accept| P --> M --> U
